      "notes": "Every node exits 0 for `--help` and 2 for an undefined flag; the root exits 0 for `--help` and `--version` and 2 for an unknown verb. Other codes a verb's help documents (such as 1 for findings or 3 for UNKNOWN) are not in this row."
